/**
 * ============================================================================
 * HUB - CHEMICALS: sanitation chemical and supply ordering
 * ============================================================================
 * Version 0.2 (phase A): the Ordering tab. Suggested carts per distributor under the cart limit (from stock, open carts,
 * weekly use worked out from the Sunday counts, and requests), paste-ready text for SAP, the cart tracker (draft, submitted,
 * approved, ordered, received), clerk requests, and alerts (quotes, prices, vendors, carts left open).
 * Version 0.1 (phase 0): the Tables tab. Every Dataverse table this hub will use, with its display and logical names, the
 * data type of every column, whether the hub needs it, and a Dataverse check that reads the TABLE DEFINITIONS (never rows,
 * apart from one tiny count per table) and says what is found, missing, typed differently or not readable.
 * Later phases add the Sunday count, the chemical log, the clerk checklist and the insight views (plan:
 * chemical-ordering-plan.md in the project folder).
 *
 * Same look as Manager Hub v6.6 (company blue / yellow / red, Tailwind from https://cdn.tailwindcss.com loaded by the page).
 * Host rule: the host compiles to ES5 with no iterable support. Only arrays, plain objects, index loops, forEach / map and
 * Promises are used: no for-of, no Set or Map, no spreading anything but arrays.
 * Writes happen only on a button press in the Ordering tab (save a draft cart, move a cart on, receive, add a request).
 * The Tables tab only reads.
 *
 * DATAVERSE MAPPING CHEAT SHEET (owned by this hub; read-only tables from other apps are listed in CH_SPEC too)
 * | craa5__c_distributor       | Distributors (Ecolab, Grainger, Vincit, Star Steel ...)                       |
 * | craa5__c_chemical          | Chemical list (item master): every chemical, test reagent, supply and PPE item that is ordered  |
 * | craa5__c_chemicalinventory | Stock now, per item and storage location                                       |
 * | craa5__c_cart              | One SAP shopping cart (header)                                                 |
 * | craa5__c_cartline          | One item on a cart, or a request waiting for the next cart                     |
 * | craa5__c_chemicalcount     | One item counted on the Sunday count                                           |
 * | craa5__c_chemicalusagelog  | Chemical log: jugs issued, point-of-use barrel changes, returns, titrations    |
 * | craa5__c_titrationtarget   | PPM target range per chemical and application                                  |
 * | craa5__c_checklisttask     | The chemical clerk checklist tasks (editable)                                  |
 * | craa5__c_clerkchecklist    | One shift's completed checklist                                                |
 * | craa5__c_chemicalstandard  | Expected chemical use per clean (links MSS cleans to chemical cost)            |
 * | craa5__c_areaalias         | Old area spellings mapped to MSS areas                                         |
 * | craa5__c_sanitationbudget  | Monthly sanitation budget (later)                                              |
 * ============================================================================
 */

